3001-6cadb507-4fc1-45de-9f84-1c3bc9347d31"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1788570329844470113,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[],"description":"## Context / Problem\nReconciler unit-test cases and fixtures under `tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/` contain confirmed comment or docstring bloat from the audit pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`. File-specific constraints must survive consolidation.\n\n## Approach\nDelegate remediation to bounded directory/subsystem leaf cohorts. Each leaf edits only its declared paths, preserves the requirements recorded in its Scope, and supplies the authoritative file-impact set. Responsibilities remain non-overlapping, and each change stays reviewable in one session.\n\n## Scope\n- Direct container edits: none; repository edits belong to the leaf cohorts.\n- Delegated repository area: Reconciler unit-test cases and fixtures under `tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/`.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every migrated path in this workstream appears in exactly one leaf Scope; verified by the migration inventory.\n- [ ] Every migrated path appears in exactly one matching file-impact record; verified by the migration inventory.\n- [ ] Each path retains every current constraint listed by its leaf Scope; verified by the leaf row-by-row completion comment.\n- [ ] Each path retains its listed consumer contract; verified by the leaf row-by-row completion comment.\n- [ ] Redundant or historical prose identified by the leaf Scope is removed; verified by the leaf row-by-row completion comment.\n- [ ] Each leaf verification command exits 0 before that leaf closes.\n\n## Child decomposition\nEach directory/subsystem cohort owns all criteria for its exact path set. Cohort path sets are disjoint; their union is this workstream scope.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"none","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","3e32-a859-2153-4a1b"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"This workstream container makes no repository edits directly. Its leaf group tickets hold the exact paths; their commits and completion comments are the implementation evidence.","parent_id":"3e32-a859-2153-4a1b","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":["rebar"],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["comments","documentation","maintainability","grouped-remediation"],"ticket_id":"bea4-b9cc-18cc-40c4","ticket_type":"story","title":"Condense reconciler unit-test comments","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["e4a3337f-17fd-464e-b37e-8cd489242741","a4159ba2-fdae-4dea-a058-9e6b271af6e7","611b1c70-edf2-479a-9512-6d59a8435bbf","6cadb507-4fc1-45de-9f84-1c3bc9347d31"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788586328517073002,"uuid":"9fd20320-a747-4b92-b71b-a92fdfb2ba4c"}